  "scope": "Three parsed fixture pairs select a Payload constructor from the second tuple field or either sum branch, then eliminate it to substitute and swap its distinct fields before resuming the trailing IndexBox field. Modes 38 through 40 recheck Pick and keep, preparation, proof sealing and runtime equality with opaque twins. Three syntax rows recover parsed source and compare with explicit literal fields. Eighteen scoped mutations drop semantic variants, substitute syntax fixtures, bypass collection, constructor or case recovery, or reverse field order. Constructor recovery and field order provide two controls. Every mutation requires a successful isolated build and its named failure. Identical edits share verified isolated execution with unchanged input hashes, exact recipes and source hashes, matching log hashes and each required failure.",
